The desktop application bundles MapLibre GL JS 6.0.0 for offline interactive
maps. MapLibre GL JS is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License. Its license is
included at public/vendor/maplibre/LICENSE.txt.

The VisionEval Workbench runtime is an unofficial distribution built from the
official VisionEval VE-40-RC6 source release at commit
f7ef3389b5626daeba6c86eeda9d172a0f8cccc2. VisionEval is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Its upstream license and source history are
preserved in the runtime image.

The runtime contains the unofficial Workbench compatibility patch
2026-08-03-composite-household-id-alignment. The patch restores predictions to
the original datastore order using complete household identifiers in
VETravelDemandMM::DoPredictions and the CalculateHouseholdDvmt and
CalculateAltModeTrips call paths. This patch and container image are not
official VisionEval releases and do not imply endorsement by VisionEval.

The bundled PlanRVA MM example contains public regional planning model inputs.
Those data are distinct from the VisionEval software and are provided as-is,
without warranty. See resources/examples/planrva-mm/NOTICE.md.
